sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as DocumentNew Page
  participant Client as documentClient
  participant Route as document.route
  participant Auth as auth middleware
  participant Service as document.service
  participant DB as Prisma and PostgreSQL

  User->>UI: 문서 제목, 유형, 본문 입력
  UI->>Client: createDocument(payload)
  Client->>Route: POST /api/documents with bearer token
  Route->>Auth: requireAuthenticatedUser
  Auth-->>Route: authenticated user
  Route->>Route: createDocumentSchema.parse
  Route->>Service: createDocument(candidateKey, actorUserId, payload)
  Service->>DB: ApplicationDocument create
  DB-->>Service: DocumentDetail
  Service-->>Route: DocumentDetail
  Route-->>Client: { data: document }
  Client-->>UI: 상세 화면으로 이동
